      <ul class="almanac-gate-list">${(s()?[["\u4E8B\u5B9E\u5168\u4ECE\u4ED3\u5E93\u81EA\u5DF1\u7684\u8D26\u4E0A\u8BFB","forge-facts\uFF1Agit log \xB7 docs/latest.json \u516B\u5B57\u6BB5 \xB7 pom modules \xB7 \u7F13\u5B58/\u538B\u6D4B regex \u5B9E\u6D4B\u884C\u2014\u2014\u8BFB\u4E0D\u5230\u5C31\u6807\u6CE8 missing\uFF0C\u4E0D\u7C89\u9970"],["Terra \u505C\u670D\u65F6\u6A21\u5757\u5207 sol \u8D70 env \u8986\u76D6","2026-11-19 aizzz account group \u95F4\u6B47\u505C\u670D terra\uFF08chat 404\uFF09\uFF1B\u672C\u6B21\u7528 `MINICC_MODEL=gpt-6.1-sol` \u5355\u6B21\u8986\u76D6\uFF0C.env \u4E0D\u52A8"],["\u4FEE\u590D\u56DE\u8DEF\u7B2C\u4E00\u6B21\u5728\u771F\u5B9E\u7AE0\u8282\u4E0A\u88AB\u89E6\u53D1","\u9996\u6B21\u8349\u62DF\u672A\u8FC7 verify \u2192 repair \u5E26\u9519\u6539\u5355 \u2192 \u7B2C\u4E8C\u6B21\u8FC7\u5951\u7EA6\uFF08keys{zh,en}\u3001en \u96F6 CJK\u3001\u2265600 \u5B57\u7B26\uFF09\uFF0Cattempts=2\uFF0Ccached 8,379/13,851\uFF0860%\uFF09"],["\u6570\u5B57\u4E00\u4E2A\u6CA1\u53D8","1,986 commits \xB7 493 batches \xB7 61 \u5377 \xB7 746 tests \xB7 1,156 tracked \xB7 55,786 roadmap lines \xB7 59,070 \u538B\u6D4B 0 non-2xx\u2014\u2014\u5168\u90E8\u9010\u5B57\u8282\u53D6\u81EA fact pack \u4E0E\u65E2\u6709\u8D26\u672C"]]:[["every fact came from the repo's own ledger","forge-facts: git log, the eight fact-pack fields of docs/latest.json, pom modules, and regex-extracted cache/pressure anchor lines \u2014 gaps are marked missing, never filled in"],["sol took over while terra was down","2026-11-19 aizzz account group flaked on terra (chat 404); this run used a per-invocation `MINICC_MODEL=gpt-6.1-sol` override; .env stayed untouched"],["the repair loop earned its keep for real","first draft failed verify, repair took the failure list back, the second passed the contract (keys {zh,en}, zero CJK, \u2265600 chars), attempts=2, cached 8,379/13,851 (60%)"],["not one number drifted","1,986 commits, 493 batches, 61 volumes, 746 tests, 1,156 tracked files, 55,786 roadmap lines, 59,070 pressure requests with zero non-2xx \u2014 all read verbatim from the fact pack and the ledgers"]]).map(([e,t])=>`<li><strong>${n(e)}</strong><span>${n(t)}</span></li>`).join("")}</ul>
