      <ul class="almanac-gate-list">${(s()?[["\u7B2C\u4E03\u5929\uFF0C\u65E7\u951A\u88AB\u9010\u6761\u6838\u5BF9","\u4E8B\u5B9E\u6765\u81EA forge-facts\uFF08git log + docs/latest.json + pom modules + \u7F13\u5B58/\u538B\u6D4B regex \u884C\uFF09\u2014\u2014\u7F3A\u5C31\u6807 missing"],["\u4FEE\u590D\u56DE\u8DEF\u88AB live \u81EA\u5DF1\u7528\u8FC7\u4E00\u8D9F","Ch.LXIII \u4FEE\u4E86\u4E00\u4E2A KeyError\uFF1Adraft/repair .get() + verify \u5224\u5206 + \u56DE\u5F52\u6D4B\u8BD5\u9501\u5B9A\uFF08M8-T1236\uFF09"],["\u622A\u65AD\u4E0D\u662F\u62B9\u6389","en \u6B63\u6587\u660E\u786E\u5199\u4E86\u300Cthe source fact is truncated here, and the ledger does not complete it\u300D\u2014\u2014\u622A\u65AD\u5C31\u662F\u622A\u65AD"],["cache \u547D\u4E2D\u8BA1\u6570\u53EA\u62A5\u5DF2\u6D4B\u9879","Measured: 8,362/8,566 = 97.6% \u6696 shard\uFF1B\u771F\u5B9E agent 48\u201372%\uFF1B\u4E24\u79CD\u6570\u5B57\u5E76\u5217\uFF0C\u4E0D\u7C89\u9970"]]:[["the seventh day re-read every anchor","facts came via forge-facts (git log + docs/latest.json + pom modules + regex-extracted cache/pressure lines); gaps are marked missing"],["the repair loop earned its keep","Ch.LXIII fixed a real KeyError: draft/repair now read with .get(), verify judges, regression test locks it (M8-T1236)"],["a truncation is not an erasure","the en body itself says the source fact is truncated here and the ledger does not complete it"],["cache hits measured, nothing more","8,362/8,566 = 97.6% warm shard; real agent traffic 48\u201372%; both numbers printed side by side"]]).map(([e,t])=>`<li><strong>${n(e)}</strong><span>${n(t)}</span></li>`).join("")}</ul>
