      <ul class="almanac-gate-list">${(s()?[["\u6865\u7B54\u4E86\uFF0C\u94FE\u8DEF\u624D\u7B97\u901A","979105b7\uFF1AJDK 25 \u4E0A\u5B9E\u6D4B gateway \u2192 Eureka \u2192 inspector \u2192 Python bridge \u5168\u94FE 200\uFF1B\u4E09\u4E2A\u73AF\u5883\u9677\u9631\u5199\u8FDB minicc-cloud/README.md \u7684\u5B9E\u6D4B runbook"],["localhost \u5728\u8FD9\u53F0 JDK \u91CC\u662F unresolved","Lettuce \u62A5 localhost/<unresolved>:26379\uFF1BTest-NetConnection \u660E\u660E\u901A\u7740\u2014\u2014\u628A host \u9489\u5728 127.0.0.1 \u624D\u8FDE\u63A5\u4E0A"],["RabbitMQ \u7F3A\u5E2D\u4F1A\u628A\u5065\u5EB7\u68C0\u67E5\u6253\u6210 503","standalone \u8DD1 gateway \u8981 --management.health.rabbit.enabled=false\uFF1Bdocker compose \u91CC broker \u5728\uFF0C\u4E0D\u5173\u8FD9\u4E2A\u4F4D"],["python \u4E0D\u5B58\u5728\u5C31\u662F\u4E0D\u5B58\u5728","\u9ED8\u8BA4 python \u672C\u673A\u6CA1\u6709\u2014\u2014--minicc.python \u6307\u5411\u771F\u5B9E\u89E3\u91CA\u5668\uFF1Bbridge \u6CA1\u6709\u9759\u9ED8\u56DE\u9000\uFF0C\u5931\u8D25\u5C31 503\uFF0C\u4E0D\u7ED9\u5047 200"]]:[["the bridge answered, so the chain counts","979105b7: JDK 25 runbook verified \u2014 gateway -> Eureka -> inspector -> Python bridge returns 200 end to end; three environment traps documented in minicc-cloud/README.md"],["localhost is unresolved inside this JDK","Lettuce reports localhost/<unresolved>:26379 while Test-NetConnection says the port is fine \u2014 pin the host to 127.0.0.1 and it connects"],["an absent RabbitMQ flips health to 503","standalone gateway runs take --management.health.rabbit.enabled=false; inside docker compose the broker exists and the indicator stays on"],["a missing python is simply missing","the default bare python does not exist here \u2014 pass --minicc.python with the real interpreter; the bridge has no silent fallback: failure leaves as 503, never as a fake 200"]]).map(([e,t])=>`<li><strong>${n(e)}</strong><span>${n(t)}</span></li>`).join("")}</ul>
